<title>USA: Read-Rite targeted in class action-lawyers.</title>
<headline>Read-Rite targeted in class action-lawyers.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Read-Rite Corp filed a class action lawsuit against the company in Caliifornia state court, alleging misrepresentation and insider trading, lawyers for the plaintiffs said Thursday.</p>
</text>
